    <title>我就是「不独立」恋爱脑，那怎么了呢？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67c7cf0d3a7e9a74b40e8b9f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67c7cf0d3a7e9a74b40e8b9f</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 05 Mar 2025 04:49:21 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期介绍】聊聊我对于“不独立”和“恋爱脑”的理解，现在主流叙事里总是说要独立，要舍弃恋爱脑，这何尝不是某种价值狭隘？</span></p><span></span><p><span>（只分享此刻心情，不提供人生建议）</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：罗丧失</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑、文案：罗丧失</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Shownotes】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 必须独立才能发展亲密关系？恋爱脑其实可能有助于亲密关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="130">02:10</a> 独立女性与男性：借力与资源整合的重要性。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="357">05:57</a> 独立与依赖：有时候有关系比独立可能更有利于发展。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="626">10:26</a> 依靠与独立：在追求独立发展的同时，如何整合身边的资源和亲密关系？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="928">15:28</a> 独立女性，何尝不是「不理想的社会环境」的衍生品？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1293">21:33</a> 恋爱脑明明是一种正常情感表现。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1682">28:02</a> 恋爱中的花费与AA制的思考</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2063">34:23</a> 理解和尊重差异：放弃网红叙事，关注自身需求，寻找适合自己的发展模式，并尊重那些愿意为他人改变和合作的人！</span></p><span></span><p><span>——</span></p><span></span><p><span>【旷野Radio】厂牌旗下栏目</span></p><span></span><p><span>都市男女的情感职场必备：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/641f08f96baef8fb20f34a3a" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/641f08f96baef8fb20f34a3a"><span>罗丧失和金子的客厅</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>普通人个人成长与搞钱：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/644d4e4d2c7b19ea1bd2a7e7" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/644d4e4d2c7b19ea1bd2a7e7"><span>金子的书房</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>寻找自己，遇见世界，有趣人类都在听的：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/653a2caba534b8a0aeb4f17b" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/653a2caba534b8a0aeb4f17b"><span>旷野地图</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>职场路上替你扫清障碍的：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6541b62a5250ea2ba