  <item>
    <title>30+理想伴侣盘点：情绪价值，还是经济实力？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/679f4294247d51713c4704c0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">679f4294247d51713c4704c0</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 05 Feb 2025 02:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期介绍】</span></p><p><span>半年没联系的恋爱小分队，重聚时变成了4个单身汉和1个已婚宝妈。有的人挑花了眼，有的人逐渐失去恋爱脑……这半年我们对情感有哪些新的见解？择偶最重要的到底是啥？</span></p><p><span>听听我们一本正经地胡言乱语吧🤫（只分享此刻心情，不提供人生建议）</span></p><p><span>主播：罗丧失，金子，小李子，夕雾，王老师</span></p><p><span>剪辑：金子</span></p><p><span>文案：金子，罗丧失</span></p><p><span>【Shownotes】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 情感近况分享！</span></p><p><span>单身的，该分的都分了！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="510">08:30</a> 生了孩子后，老公不重要了？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a> 30+择偶条件分享</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a> 30+的谈恋爱现状：写招亲启事，漏斗筛选和赛马逻辑</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1663">27:43</a> 年薪20w的男性和40w+择偶逻辑大不同。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1794">29:54</a> 我们心目中的理想伴侣是什么样？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2100">35:00</a> 门当户对的标签和世俗不匹配的关系，如何衡量？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2280">38:00</a> 我们心中的婚姻焦虑，到底是真实存在的还是被动引起的？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3540">59:00</a> 推婚恋，赶紧上床才是正经事？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3720">1:02:00</a> 管理dating对象、对比条件，到底是不是一种功利？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4373">1:12:53</a> 30岁的我，健身、交友、旅行、不存钱……是不是不成熟？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4620">1:17:00</a> 生了孩子，节省了？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5340">1:29:00</a> 父母催婚：亲密关系的顺利，也是原生关系亲密的反映</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5490">1:31:30</a> 择偶背后的家庭分工：男女生在什么情况下多付出？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5833">1:37:13</a> 如何通过“有效约会”快速了解适配程度？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6540">1:49:00</a> 别既要又要，经济价值和情绪价值请拎清</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7983">2:13:03</a> 聊聊新年计划：瞄定方向，随机应变。</span></p><p><span>——</span></p><p><span>【旷野Radio】厂牌旗下栏目</span></p><p><span>都市男女的情感职场必备：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/641f08f96baef8fb20f34a3a" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/641f08f96baef8fb20f34a3a"><span>罗丧失和金子的客厅</span></a></p><p><span>普通人个人成长与搞钱：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/644d4e4d2c7b19ea1bd2a7e7" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/644d4e4d2c7b19ea1bd2a7e7"><span>金子的书房</span></a></p><p><span>寻找自己，遇见世界，有趣人类都在听的：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/653a2caba534b8a0aeb4f17b" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/653a2caba534b8a0aeb4f17b"><span>旷野地图</span></a></p><p><span>职场路上替你扫清障碍的：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6541b62a5250ea2baa667445" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6541b62a5250ea2baa667445"><span>旷野地雷</span></a></p><p><span>欢迎大家添加微信小助手：SangsaL，加入我们的听友群，与海内外热辣的朋友们一起挖掘当代年轻人的工作、情感、生活话题~</span></p>]]></description>
