    <pubDate>Thu, 12 Dec 2024 04:12:56 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期介绍】</span></p><p><span>最近我又和男创业者聊天呢，而且因为我服务不少老板，感受到了很多「男性视角」。</span></p><p><span>（没剪辑）</span></p><p><span>主播：</span></p><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/C6hkUFwmnhazIXvvHj1UJw" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/C6hkUFwmnhazIXvvHj1UJw"><span>罗丧失</span></a><span> 公众号【罗丧失】：体验不同人生的罗丧失。</span></p><p><span>【Shownotes】</span></p><p><span>（大概写写）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 男老板独有的「女秘书经济」：把控住了情绪的上下限</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="240">04:00</a> 情绪价值如何体现在男老板逻辑里？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a> 为什么外在内在都要提升自己？——因为漏斗效应。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="420">07:00</a> 从生物学的角度为什么做小伏低？怎么成为一个灵活的人？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="540">09:00</a> 为什么我要理解「男性视角」？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="660">11:00</a> 为什么职场上我更容易和男性打交道？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a> 如何用女性力量去增加成功率？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a> 算关系账的潜规则。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1190">19:50</a> 为什么男生追求你前后变了？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1230">20:30</a> 基本盘稳健的人和不稳定的基本盘的人怎么筛选？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1380">23:00</a> 借假修真，抓大放小。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1440">24:00</a> 被拉黑删除也要做逆风翻盘局。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1620">27:00</a> 主体意识到底是什么？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1800">30:00</a> 做实验+博概率=理性思维降低内耗。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1980">33:00</a> 思维的自由很重要。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2280">38:00</a> 你想吃得好，就得做事情。</span></p><p><span>——</span></p><p><span>【旷野Radio】厂牌旗下栏目</span></p><p><span>都市男女的情感职场必备：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/641f08f96baef8fb20f34a3a" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/641f08f96baef8fb20f34a3a"><span>罗丧失和金子的客厅</span></a></p><p><span>普通人个人成长与搞钱：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/644d4e4d2c7b19ea1bd2a7e7" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/644d4e4d2c7b19ea1bd2a7e7"><span>金子的书房</span></a></p><p><span>寻找自己，遇见世界，有趣人类都在听的：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/653a2caba534b8a0aeb4f17b" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/653a2caba534b8a0aeb4f17b"><span>旷野地图</span></a></p><p><span>职场路上替你扫清障碍的：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6541b62a5250ea2baa667445" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6541b62a5250ea2baa667445"><span>旷野地雷</span></a></p><p><span>欢迎大家添加微信小助手：SangsaL，加入我们的听友群，与海内外热辣的朋友们一起挖掘当代年轻人的工作、情感、生活话题~</span></p>]]></description>
