    <guid isPermaLink="false">675831b8bdb9877a97d2064d</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 10 Dec 2024 12:27:06 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期介绍】</span></p><p><span>男女生是两种生物！</span></p><p><span>我b溃了！我真的b溃了！和一个比我年长的男生聊了情感婚恋观我真的震撼我全家。（我的问题我太理想化了！）</span></p><p><span>（没剪辑）</span></p><p><span>主播：</span></p><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/C6hkUFwmnhazIXvvHj1UJw" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/C6hkUFwmnhazIXvvHj1UJw"><span>罗丧失</span></a><span> 公众号【罗丧失】：体验不同人生的罗丧失。</span></p><p><span>【Shownotes】</span></p><p><span>（大概写写）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 谈恋爱要找喜欢的，找老婆要找不喜欢的？？？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a> 救命，结婚结的是：情感价值和实用价值！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">03:00</a> 为什么有些人出轨？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="240">04:00</a> 浓烈的感情不会带来稳定关系。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a> 很多人在20几岁就死了。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="420">07:00</a> 雄性激素和雌性激素如何造就了思维差异？爱情是两种东西！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a> 为什么渣男特别狠？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="840">14:00</a> 被压抑的爱欲：真的爱情似乎都没有好结果。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a> 好畸形啊！结构性的社会差异真的不能改变吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1140">19:00</a> 体面的分手是健康关系的毒药！！被蒙蔽的分手潜规则！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1260">21:00</a> 让你选择约会场景也是坑！！处处都是坑！！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1320">22:00</a> 一些进退两难的规则！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a> 我已经听不懂真话了！</span></p><p><span>——</span></p><p><span>【旷野Radio】厂牌旗下栏目</span></p><p><span>都市男女的情感职场必备：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/641f08f96baef8fb20f34a3a" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/641f08f96baef8fb20f34a3a"><span>罗丧失和金子的客厅</span></a></p><p><span>普通人个人成长与搞钱：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/644d4e4d2c7b19ea1bd2a7e7" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/644d4e4d2c7b19ea1bd2a7e7"><span>金子的书房</span></a></p><p><span>寻找自己，遇见世界，有趣人类都在听的：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/653a2caba534b8a0aeb4f17b" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/653a2caba534b8a0aeb4f17b"><span>旷野地图</span></a></p><p><span>职场路上替你扫清障碍的：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6541b62a5250ea2baa667445" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6541b62a5250ea2baa667445"><span>旷野地雷</span></a></p><p><span>欢迎大家添加微信小助手：SangsaL，加入我们的听友群，与海内外热辣的朋友们一起挖掘当代年轻人的工作、情感、生活话题~</span></p>]]></description>
